{"id":"vod_jy_43966","vodId":"43966","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"冰菓","name_cn":"冰菓","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第22集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/c37cc97f8ce18a041b73ae6a749c55a0.jpg"},"summary":"本片是以神木高中“古典部”为舞台，围绕四个部员折木奉太郎、千反田爱瑠、福部里志、伊原摩耶花展开的校园推理剧。神木高中一年级生折木奉太郎是一个“节能”主义者，他信奉“不必要的事不做，非做不可的事就尽快解决”，过着“灰色”的高中生活。不参加任何社团的他，却因为姐姐的拜托而加入了濒临废部的“古典部”。在古典部他结识了好奇心旺盛的千金小姐千反田爱瑠，国中好友福部里志、伊原摩耶花也相继加入古典部。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-04 18:00:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRXMKKa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/wdLGY1Ab/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dBv8XNd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/mbkgwjEb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe7Mnyrb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/NbW1wBve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le33jJxe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Qe1MYpPe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9avwYJXb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmk2Xre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集上","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Pe9jpXZa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集下","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/mbkgwLxb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqoVkRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJ1Y9lb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/mbkgwLYb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/wdLGYzgb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRXMJLa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqoVn3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集